# ── RepoLens AI backend ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# RepoLens runs on either of two FREE backends. Pick one:

# (A) LOCAL — Ollama on your machine (the default; private, no key needed):
#   1. Install Ollama:  https://ollama.com
#   2. Pull a model:    ollama pull mistral
#   3. Start it:        ollama serve
# Optional override:
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1

# (B) HOSTED — Groq's free tier (use this for a public live demo, e.g. Vercel).
#   Grab a free key at https://console.groq.com/keys, then set:
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_your_key_here

# Optional: choose the model for whichever backend is active.
# Defaults: "mistral" (Ollama) · "llama-3.3-70b-versatile" (Groq)
# AI_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile

# Optional: GitHub token to raise the API rate limit from 60 → 5,000 req/hr.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_your_token_here
